WEBVTT

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.550
Have you never seen a doll like this before?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.800
Nope!

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.430
You must be a genius inventor, uncle!

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.560
This is a mechanical doll
that comes from the Far East.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.770
When you're in Liman,

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.400
many unusual tools and mechanical arts
find their way to you.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.150
And you're planning to use
the knowledge you learn there

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:34.320
to benefit me and Muzrak sometime down the road,
aren't you, Beyazit?

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.870
I am counting on you.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.740
Yes, brother.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.080
I will help you in any way I can.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.950
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:25.850
The Prince of Swords

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:28.270
Assassinate the sultans
at Prens Orhan's wedding?!

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.520
This is a rather bold move.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:34.820
If that's the case, the representative we send
to the ceremony will be an issue.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.700
Being that there's no guarantee they'd return alive...

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:40.700
Buyuk Pasha,

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.580
my house has fostered a deep relationship

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:47.250
with the sultans across the many generations.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:51.000
I believe I may be most suited for this role.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.460
That is true.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.750
Your house is one of the most prestigious
noble families of Torqye.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:59.010
You also understand how to conduct yourself
with the sultans.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:02.050
Would you do this for us, Saluja Pasha?

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.850
It would be my honor.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:06.100
I, Tesisatu-Kapu Saluja,

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.560
am prepared to stake my life

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.850
in the name of peace for Birlik Torqye.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.910
That Zaganos!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.780
Assassinating the sultans is absurd!

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:26.660
The five nations should be equals.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:27.950
I shall

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.420
lead Birlik Torqye to become
the union it should be!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.170
Taking men known for their pro-sultan leanings.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.960
Buyuk Pasha is a harsh man.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:43.180
He seems to say that he would not care
if these men never returned.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.550
Acayip, capital of Kuluch Sultanlu
Suburb

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.600
Hey there, welcome back.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.230
Mahmut Bey.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.400
I've read your plan for the wedding.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:00.030
I have no issue with the troop positioning
or the plan of action.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:04.160
However, even if all goes well,
the trouble will come afterwards.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.740
You understand that, don't you?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.290
Why would the people support a coup

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.250
brought about by a distasteful
assassination?

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.790
This is merely an alternative idea.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.960
But instead of assassinating the sultans
at the wedding,

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:23.220
once Orhan becomes the new sultan and announces
his open support for Birlik Torqye,

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:28.010
we can simply use our armies to suppress
the remaining three sultanlus.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.350
No.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:30.930
If it comes to civil war,

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.770
the people will be split
into different factions.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.860
This matter should be handled within the ruling class.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.440
So you are saying you will get their support by

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.240
this coup accomplished through assassination?

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.570
With what kind of magic?

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.370
Three nights from now,

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:49.280
please come to the circle plaza in Acayip.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.080
I will show you my magic.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.380
The foolish four sultans!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.750
They sell the souls of their own homelands

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.340
to an evil foreign nation of demons.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.470
The miserable Sultan Balaban.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.640
Consumed by his own blind ambition,

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.680
he points his blade of darkness

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.730
towards his brethren and comrades.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.980
The truth is known by Beyazit.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.440
The truth is known by Prenses Aishe.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.940
Even when their lives are in danger,

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.400
they wander throughout the lands

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:27.240
in neither heaven nor hell,

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.530
fighting for peace in Birlik Torqye,

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.990
shedding the light on the truth

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.160
from now until eternity!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.090
Wonderful!

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.590
That's what you'd expect
from the best dancers in Altu!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.630
Although, I know it was just a play,

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:49.340
but it seemed like the prenses and her uncle
were a little too close.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.140
The younger brother is right!

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.350
What foreign nation?

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.060
That has to be the Empire.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:58.400
It's scary having such a blatantly ambitious sultan...

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.860
I see.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.690
That's quite the magic,

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.610
Mahmut Bey.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.320
It was a wonderful performance.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.990
Honestly, asking us to put this together in three days?!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.950
Do you know how hard that was?

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.410
I'm grateful.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.710
Well, it was a good experience.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.130
We'll take this new production

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:23.710
and stir up support for regime change
throughout the four nations.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.510
Thank you.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.300
No matter what happens now,

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.970
even if I were to die,

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:33.060
please continue performing this play
for the next six months.

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.980
Stop talking like that

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.310
and work hard enough not to die.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.150
I'm glad to see you again,
even if only briefly.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:49.530
How do I say this? I got to see
an unexpected side of you.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:53.200
I didn't think you would be a fan of turning
political matters into a play

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:54.990
to expose it to the public.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.200
Because simply putting on the play

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.620
will increase public approval
for the next sultan.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.170
Even if we fall upon devious tactics for a coup,

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.130
we can expect a certain level of support
from the people.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.050
If we're able to deny the Empire an opening to attack,

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.220
that is the best course of action.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.510
It's a play starring you, prenses.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.430
Are you sure you didn't want to see it?

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.430
I already know about myself without having
to watch a play.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.690
That's true.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:24.270
I guess there's nothing else
but to wait for the sultans

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.900
to casually show up as planned.

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:27.400
If they do not come,

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.070
then Kuluch will openly switch support to Torqye,

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:33.490
and then it becomes a simple matter of slowly
closing our forces around them.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.490
But it's hard to imagine the volatile Balaban

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.790
will stay quiet on the matter.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.040
Shark, capital of Muzrak Sultanlu
Crimson Palace

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:43.710
Yes, I have received an invitation from Kuluch
to attend the wedding,

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.920
but is what you said true,
Saluja Pasha?

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.210
Yes. Torqye is convinced

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:53.180
that the four sultanlus have made secret deals
with the Empire without evidence.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.100
However, a wise individual like yourself

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:58.600
would never do such a thing.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.150
Thanks to you,

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:10.740
we were able to avoid a foolish fight
between families.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.490
I shall have my 10,000 yenicheris

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.450
accompany me to Selim's son's wedding.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.750
Saluja Pasha, let us rebuild
the Birlik Torqye union together.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:25.080
I believed you would say so.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:35.090
Father never wished for war with the Empire.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.350
While we may be called a sultanlu,

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:41.100
we are not even allowed to make
our own decision to go to war or not.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.640
We will make Muzrak strong, Beyazit!

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.400
Or else we will continue to be a nation

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.820
that is unable to choose their own path!

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:54.360
Quickly send a messenger to Balta and Buchak!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.240
We will use Torqye's own ploy against them

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:01.080
and crush Kuluch with the full force
of our three nations' armies!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.410
Saluja Pasha has changed course

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.380
and entered the palace
of the Muzrak Sultanlu.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.790
This is for the best.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:12.800
Balaban will surely take action
due to Saluja Pasha's reckless decision.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.880
He will attack Kuluch,
leaving his own country empty.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.260
Yes.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:20.430
Gentlemen. We must not squander
this opportunity.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.230
We will dispatch our army while the sultans are away,

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.520
and take control of the major cities

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.690
in Muzrak, Balta and Buchak.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.480
Zaganos Pasha! That is not what we discussed!

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:34.190
I thought the plan was to assassinate the sultans!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.320
If we hold control of their home bases,

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:38.820
it will resolve all of our issues.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:42.160
It is easy to control a nation with an absent ruler.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.330
This is our perfect opportunity.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.630
I trust there is no need for a vote
at this late stage in the game.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.170
Very well. Zaganos Pasha will have
full rein of our forces.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.340
Thank you.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.510
When the enemy forces
enter Kuluch's capital of Acayip,

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:59.550
our troops will march into the three sultanlus,

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.560
and take the major cities within five days!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.350
Even if the sultans realize what we've done

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.100
and turn back from Acayip, it will be too late.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.560
We can't give the Empire an opening!

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.320
Mother! Uncle!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.860
I am going over to see the Buchak troops!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.280
Sultan of Balta
Nilufer Fatma

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.240
Fatma, you have an intelligent son.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.700
I only have a foolish younger brother.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.960
This is all Beyazit's doing!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.380
This time I will kill him with my own hands.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.800
Wedding dresses are heavier than I thought.

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.350
So beautiful.

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.810
You are too beautiful, prenses.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:51.940
Oh, how long have I waited for this day.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:57.490
The wedding will be held in the palace's great hall.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.820
Prens Orhan and Sultan Selim,

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.620
as well as the other sultans,

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:05.120
will be waiting for the bride's entrance.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:08.120
As soon as the prenses' foot touches the hall floor,

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.250
we will assassinate the three sultans at once.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.750
The assassination will be carried out

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:17.510
by us as well as the Orquesta members
disguised as palace guards.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:21.260
However, I would like all of you
to keep a sword on your person

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:24.010
and be prepared for anything to happen.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.810
They are prepared to do what's necessary.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.310
But I'd like to avoid having a child and a brother

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.440
directly murdering their parent and brother.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:37.150
Will I even be able to wield a sword in this?

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.320
Would you like to go out back and give it a try?

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.200
I'll accompany you.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:57.500
It seems like you can handle it well enough.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:00.630
You will have me and the Orquesta
with you on the actual day.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.470
The dress suits you,

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:09.060
but I never imagined
you would get married this soon.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:11.730
Uncle,

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:14.270
when I was little,

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:18.070
I had thought I would marry you.

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:22.110
I knew that would never happen.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.950
I only wished that...

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:29.830
Uncle, would you rub my head
one last time for me?

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.830
I loved when you used to do that.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.630
Once the wedding ends, we will no longer be able to

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:40.840
interact like this, even though
we are uncle and niece.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:45.300
My only wish is for my uncle to live a happy life,

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.850
and smile whenever we see each other.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.850
Prenses Aishe.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.850
Back then,

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:58.770
I also thought I would marry you in the future as well.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.280
Acayip, capital of Kuluch Sultanlu
Indigo Palace

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.580
Prens.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:16.250
You did not know about the prenses' feelings
until now?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.670
I see that marrying me

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:24.260
does not bring the prenses any happiness at all.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:28.430
What should I do then?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.770
Prenses Aishe is a splendid prenses.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:35.440
The path she desires and the path desired of her.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.730
When the time comes to choose one,

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.520
people want to take the former.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.570
The least you can do, prens,

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:46.570
is to become a sultan that can make
decisions the prenses can be proud of.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.240
Yes, Father.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.660
Mahmut Bey.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.750
The reason you were chosen
to orchestrate the rebellion

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.710
is because you can be easily cast away
if it should come to it.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:01.290
You once asked if I had
any objections to this rebellion,

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.670
and I would ask you the same.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.470
If casting me away allows them to avoid
the worst from happening,

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.430
then I am willing to die for it.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:16.810
Torqye has allowed me to do
what I've always wanted to do.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.310
I am jealous.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:23.230
Both you and what you've come to love

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.820
share the same sense of justice.

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.120
How could you construct this route and create
a trade agreement with the Empire?!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.950
Beyazit, Muzrak is a free country.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:37.330
Why would we need Torqye's consent
to make deals with other nations?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.620
Brother!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:39.830
That day,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.380
our ideas of justice became misaligned.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.590
If I were able,

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:48.680
I would have walked by your side forever.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.930
August 31st, Torqyean Year 75
Prens Orhan's Wedding

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.400
Wow! This is crazy!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.990
This is how much fanfare a prens
gets for getting married?

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.360
Festivals are nice.

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.030
Mahmut!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.040
It's a message from Zaganos Pasha!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.540
From Zaganos Pasha?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:33.050
What is it, Mahmut?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.430
That isn't a diplomatic envoy,

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.350
it's the armies of the three sultanlus
here to take the castle!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.730
What did you say?!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.350
Zaganos Pasha

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.980
wishes us to take on their forces.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:48.690
And while we do that, they'll be taking down
the empty headquarters, huh?

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:52.280
Kiros! Please get the citizens outside the castle
to evacuate inside!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:57.040
Suleyman Bey, please ask Sultan Selim to allow me
command over the Kuluch--

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.500
Sultan Selim is in danger!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.170
Abiriga, go with Suleyman Bey to ensure his safety!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.130
Understood, Padrone.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.540
Leave it to us!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.130
Why?

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.340
Why, Zaganos Pasha?!

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.340
If the assassinations were successful,

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.430
we wouldn't have had to spill
any needless blood!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.390
Sultan Selim!

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.440
We will have him pay for switching over
to Torqye's side!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:26.150
I have urgent business with the sultan!

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:28.230
P-- Please wait!

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.400
-He's not here.
-Find him!

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.870
What is it, Father?!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.450
The situation has changed.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.290
Balaban discovered our plans.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:41.580
What?!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.710
As it stands, Kuluch will have to offer the traitors' heads

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.420
to try to quell Balaban's fury.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.670
The prenses will have to die here.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.340
Please wait, Father!

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.930
I am sorry, prens.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.890
This is my decision.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.100
Father!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:01.470
I did not think
I would have to draw my sword here.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.350
The wedding is canceled!

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:06.900
Soldiers, lead the citizens back inside the walls!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.190
Assassination is impossible now.

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.950
We will join the units deployed outside the walls.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.490
Yes.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.450
Prenses.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.540
Prenses!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.340
Do not interfere, prens.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:42.680
Don't move!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.690
Leave the room!

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.980
Get out!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.060
If you do anything to Prenses Aishe,

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.190
consider Sultan Selim's life forfeited!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.610
A hidden passageway.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:01.200
Let's go, we will find Selim and...

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:06.000
Is that the way Sultan Selim went?

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.750
You bastards!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.550
Father...

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.220
Please reconsider.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:23.720
You cannot kill Prenses Aishe...

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.190
Kuluch does not have the power

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.900
to stand against the armies
of the three sultanlus.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:33.150
I can either offer the prenses and the other rebels
to save Kuluch,

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:36.280
or fight against Balaban
and be prepared to accept destruction.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:40.620
We have to choose one or the other.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.780
I don't know the answer.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:47.250
I am not like you or Prenses Aishe.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.460
I may have been born the son of a sultan,

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:52.000
but I know nothing about

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.590
politics or war.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.760
But killing the prenses...

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.260
So you would forsake your people...

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.270
Forgive me.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:11.400
I am sultan!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:31.790
So this

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:35.340
is what you've decided, prens?

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:37.210
The least you can do, prens,

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:41.510
is to become a sultan that can make
decisions the prenses can be proud of.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:43.010
Father!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.560
You fool!

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.890
Do not lose heart,

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.730
Orhan.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:58.780
This is the path you decided to take...

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:01.150
A decision you made yourself.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.530
Father...

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.200
Sultan Selim, are you all right?

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:16.000
Captain!

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.920
Are you planning on waiting
for the city to be surrounded?!

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:21.970
Please lend me your soldiers!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.800
You say that

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:29.180
Kuluch was actually working alongside Torqye with you.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:33.140
But I have not heard any of this from the sultan.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.440
We only move on the sultan's orders.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.440
-Take him.
-Stop!

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:46.820
Sheath your swords!

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.660
He is our ally.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:55.710
Mahmut Bey is an agent of Torqye, and one month ago,

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:58.290
my father made a secret pact with him.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.710
But today...

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:03.800
With the three sultanlus' attack on our city,
my father revoked his promise

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:07.890
and cowardly decided to offer my dear wife's head
to the enemies outside our walls

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:09.810
in an attempt to buy their forgiveness!

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.930
Such a cowardly man who would break his word

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:15.270
is not fit to be sultan!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.940
So I have

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.740
taken the life of my father Selim!

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:26.450
I am now Sultan of Kuluch!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.450
What have you done?

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.040
Captain.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:34.290
If you cannot accept this, then strike me down now.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.920
You are the one who has command of our forces.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.290
Those outside are the enemy.

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.510
If that is what the sultan says,

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.090
then we simply abide.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:46.430
The royal guard

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:49.430
serve at the pleasure of the Sultan of Kuluch.

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:51.930
Sultan Orhan.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:54.930
Very well, then.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.980
My royal guard!

00:21:57.150 --> 00:21:58.980
Cooperate with Mahmut Bey

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:02.940
and protect our realm
from the enemies outside our walls!

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:05.650
Our lives for Kuluch!

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:50.680
An older brother's ambition,
a younger brother's hopes.

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:55.260
I can only stand by and watch
its unavoidable conclusion.

00:23:55.470 --> 00:23:57.770
Next time,
"Battle at the Unusual Rock Formations."

00:23:57.930 --> 00:24:01.270
The parting gunshots echo in the twilight.
